Error [E2806]: Convention file `routes_commented/About.jet` has no `fn page`
  --> tests/ui/web_app_routes_commented.jet:4:27
    |
  4 | fn run() App -> web.app().routes(from: "routes_commented").csr()
    |                           ^^^^^^
 Why: Every file under a `.routes(from:)` root must declare `fn page` or start with `_` to opt out (D-WEBAUTHOR1)
 Fix: Add `fn page()`, rename the file with a leading `_`, or remove it from the routes directory
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2806
